'''''Lycaste macrophylla''''' is a species of terrestrial [[orchid]] native to [[Costa Rica]], [[Nicaragua]], [[Panama]], [[Colombia]], [[Ecuador]], [[Venezuela]], [[Peru]] and [[Bolivia]].<ref name= lacroix>{{cite book |title= The New Encyclopedia of Orchids: 1500 Species in Cultivation |last1= La Croix |first1= I. F. |last2 =Aubron |first2 = Manuel |year=2008 |publisher= [[Timber Press]] |isbn= 978-0-88192-876-1 |page= 254 |url= https://books.google.com/books?id=4sYMDkrbHuIC}}</ref> It is the [[type species]] of the genus ''[[Lycaste]]''.

